        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359910/extras/6872cfa09b21ffe9914f6e55d7e6b2b2.avif?t=1769414084\" width=1280 height=302 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A frenzied arcade fighter like no other! Tag battle bedlam from 1996—now on Steam!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic online matches, New feature-rich Practice Mode, Frenetic 4-player fights!<br>This edition comes retrofitted with rollback netcode for fun, fast-paced online. Game speed selectors, a hitbox<br>viewer, and other new training functions help prepare you for the battles ahead.<br>Unite and fight in the most engaging KIZUNA ENCOUNTER version to date! The whole world awaits!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > 10 warriors, 2 ruthless bosses—1 apocalyptic fight for the future!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 returnees from the previous installment “SAVAGE REIGN”.<br>Square up with 2 brand-new fighters: resistance leader Rosa and cane-fighting crusader Kim.<br>You can even take boss characters King Leo and Jyazu into battle!<br>(1v1 and 1v2 battles only )</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359910/extras/5e03471f37c1355b7185138e4a83392d.avif?t=1769414084\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thrilling online matches! Multiplayer mayhem with 4 players at once!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in seamless dystopian duels powered by rollback netcode. Multiple tournament formats let you mix it up in lobbies for up to 9 players.<br>You can even team up and throw down with fellow challengers in simultaneous 4-player battles—a feature limited to<br>select arcade cabinets at the time of original release!<br>Tag with the best brawlers and take the fight worldwide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359910/extras/babf38348eaee52d168f129b72698e91.avif?t=1769414084\" width=1280 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Modern-day overhaul for an arcade classic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the new and improved Practice Mode, where you can tailor lab sessions to your needs—complete with speed selectors, a hitbox viewer, and more. Master brutal combos as you prepare for each formidable matchup!<br>An integrated jukebox (featuring the game's soundtrack) and a diverse collection of achievement challenges round<br>out the suite of single-player content.<br>The result—an expanded KIZUNA ENCOUNTER experience for the modern day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3359910/extras/68a164baf446ff8c12df535eea2b35c7.avif?t=1769414084\" width=1280 height=360 /></span></p>",
